\hich\f2\strike0\ulnone\cf2 Her response set off criticism from human rights activists. \u8220 Choosing who you represent is a personal decision. No one is a traitor for that,\u8221  wrote the Digital Citizens for Human Rights, an X account that focuses on China. \u8220 You don\u8217 t need to speak for power. But you cannot claim innocence while benefiting from it.\u8221 }
