\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2\strike0\ulnone\cf2 Even on Chinese social media, Ms. Gu is a divisive figure. While many Chinese people hail her as a hero and address her adoringly as the \u8220 snow princess,\u8221  some criticize her for having the privilege of being \u8220 a part-time Chinese\u8221  \u8212  being Chinese when it is profitable and American when it is convenient.}
